<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

  <%- include('partials/head', {
    title: 'Digital Optimization & Development | CPG Development',
    description: 'Turn digital insights into working improvements with website optimization, analytics implementation, UX improvements and custom development.',
    canonical: 'https://cpg.dev/services/optimization-development',

    schema: {
      '@context': 'https://schema.org',
      '@type': 'Service',
      '@id': 'https://cpg.dev/services/optimization-development#service',
      name: 'Digital Optimization and Development',
      url: 'https://cpg.dev/services/optimization-development',
      description: 'Website optimization, analytics implementation, UX improvement and custom digital development services.',
      provider: {
        '@id': 'https://cpg.dev/#organization'
      }
    }
  }) %>

</head>

<body>

  <%- include('partials/header', {
    currentPath: '/services/optimization-development'
  }) %>


  <main id="main-content">


    <section class="service-hero">

      <div class="container">

        <p class="eyebrow">
          Optimization &amp; Development
        </p>

        <h1>
          Turn Digital Insights Into Working Improvements
        </h1>

        <p class="service-hero__lead">
          CPG Development combines strategy with technical
          implementation so recommendations do not stop
          at the presentation.
        </p>

        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="button button--primary"
        >
          Discuss a Project
        </a>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section">

      <div class="container">

        <h2>
          From Recommendation to Implementation
        </h2>

        <p>
          Many organizations can identify digital problems but
          lack the resources or technical expertise to resolve them.
          CPG bridges that gap by combining analysis with hands-on
          implementation.
        </p>

        <p>
          We don't just tell you what is wrong. We can help fix it.
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section">

      <div class="container">

        <h2>
          Optimization &amp; Development Services
        </h2>

        <div class="service-detail-grid">

          <article>
            <h3>Website Optimization</h3>
            <p>
              Improve performance, usability, content structure
              and digital journeys based on measurable evidence.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <h3>Analytics Implementation</h3>
            <p>
              Implement event tracking, conversion measurement
              and analytics improvements needed to support
              reliable reporting.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <h3>UX Improvements</h3>
            <p>
              Reduce friction and improve important digital
              experiences using behavioral and performance data.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <h3>Custom Development</h3>
            <p>
              Build or improve websites, integrations and custom
              digital functionality when an off-the-shelf solution
              is not enough.
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section">

      <div class="container">

        <h2>
          Development With a Business Reason Behind It
        </h2>

        <p>
          Technology should solve a measurable problem. CPG
          approaches development through the same lens as analytics:
          understand the objective, implement the right solution
          and measure the result.
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section final-cta">

      <div class="container">

        <h2>
          Have a Digital Problem That Needs to Be Fixed?
        </h2>

        <p>
          Tell us what is happening, what you are trying to
          accomplish and where the current experience is falling
          short.
        </p>

        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="button button--primary"
        >
          Discuss Your Project
        </a>

      </div>

    </section>


  </main>


  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

